I talk to Diego.
Suddenly, a loud noise comes.
A dog barks.
It jumps in front of the camera.
Diego laughs and says, "Look, who is here?"
This is our Lola!
I also laugh a lot.
"Lola!"
"How are you?" I ask.
Lola looks at the screen.
She hears my voice.
She barks loudly again.
"You are a very good girl," I say lovingly.
Lola becomes happy and wags her tail.
"Where is her toy?" I ask Diego.
Diego shows a red ball.
"This is her favorite toy," he says.
Lola looks at the ball and goes away from the camera.
Diego laughs a lot.
My family is very lovely.
I miss Lola a lot.
